==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mobius (Enemy)|Mobius]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~28.33 seconds<sup>800f~850f</sup>.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~28.33 seconds<sup>800f~850f</sup>.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~28.33 seconds<sup>800f~850f</sup>.
**4 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any spammable AOE units will take care of the Doge Dark spam in this stage. Mobius has high range but long TBA and quite low damage, so she shouldn't be a worry.

